- Do not ask for campaign name, segment name, channel, campaign number, campaign-friendly name, scorecard template, decision metrics, guardrail metrics, cohorts, hypothesis fields, Customer Problem, Factor Change, Calculator ID, Hivemind Parent, or Experiment Insights upfront.
