### Experiment Insights mapping

**Derive from Jira/Confluence, then map to exactly one allowed value:**
- `hivemind experiment` — prior Hivemind/A/B test, experiment scorecard, previous test learning
- `dashboard` — Tableau, Looker, Power BI, BI/metrics dashboard
- `full story` — FullStory, session replay, rage click analysis
- `customer research` — UX research, customer interviews, VOC, surveys, usability testing
